    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shadow of the Cherry Trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a magical and mysterious world where nature and Japanese tradition collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this moving adventure game, play as Hana, a courageous young girl determined to save her friend Yuki, imprisoned by an ancient guardian in a forgotten temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore enchanted forests, solve puzzles inspired by Japanese culture, and communicate with spirits to restore balance between nature and the spirit world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a story filled with emotion, magic, and respect for tradition. Use wisdom, courage, and love to triumph in this unforgettable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A poetic and captivating adventure awaits, where every choice influences your destiny.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive exploration of magical forests inspired by Japanese tradition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solving puzzles based on culture and spirituality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Interacting with spirits and mythical creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Touching storytelling, full of mystery and emotion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enchanting visuals and immersive anime-style soundtrack</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shadow of the Cherry Trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a magical and mysterious world where nature and Japanese tradition collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this moving adventure game, play as Hana, a courageous young girl determined to save her friend Yuki, imprisoned by an ancient guardian in a forgotten temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore enchanted forests, solve puzzles inspired by Japanese culture, and communicate with spirits to restore balance between nature and the spirit world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a story filled with emotion, magic, and respect for tradition. Use wisdom, courage, and love to triumph in this unforgettable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A poetic and captivating adventure awaits, where every choice influences your destiny.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive exploration of magical forests inspired by Japanese tradition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solving puzzles based on culture and spirituality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Interacting with spirits and mythical creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Touching storytelling, full of mystery and emotion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enchanting visuals and immersive anime-style soundtrack</p>",
